{
  "title": "High-Protein Turkey Meatball Marinara with Chickpea Pasta",
  "description": "Tender lean turkey meatballs simmered in marinara sauce and served over high-protein chickpea pasta for a satisfying weeknight dinner. This macro-friendly meal delivers plenty of protein in under 30 minutes. Save it for your next meal prep.",
  "cuisine": "Italian-American",
  "category": "Dinner",
  "servings": 4,
